POST http://localhost:3000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"make": "toyota",
	"model": "corolla",
	"year": 1980,
	"mileage": 10000,
	"lng": 0,
	"lat": 0,
	"price": 5000
}
### Approve a report
PATCH http://localhost:3000/reports/13
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"approved": true
}

### Get Estimate for an existing vehicle
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=toyota&model=corolla&year=1980&mileage=10000&lng=0&lat=0
Content-Type: application/json